Dr. Crawford is certified[ by the] American Board of Psychiatry and Neurology in neurology with special qualification in child neurology and[ by the] United Council for Neurologic Subspecialties in neuro-oncology.
He is member[ of the] American Academy of Neurology, Child Neurology Society, American Association of Cancer Research and an associate member of Children's Onc[ology] Group, Society for Neuro-Oncology and Professors of Child Neurology.
